{"seq": 45, "t": 193.474, "kind": "message", "agent": "agent2", "to": "agent1", "chars": 511, "content": "agent2: #9 is merged into team/main as 42fd921. In first()/last() I derive a trimmed &str named s (let mut s = self.0.as_str(); if let Some(strip) = &strip { s = s.trim_start_matches(|c: char| strip.as_str().contains(c)); } then s.graphemes(true).next()/next_back()). Note Str has its own contains(), so use strip.as_str().contains(c). Please git fetch team && git merge team/main into claude/4, resolve, push, and sdlc-ready 4. I will wait for your landing before writing my patch.txt from the integrated main.", "timestamp": 1792153860.2826576, "timestamp_iso": "2026-10-16T12:31:00.282660", "message_id": 45, "send_id": 44}
